# `make ios` re-runs uniffi-bindgen-react-native, which regenerates a podspec
# matching the package.json name (`mopro-ffi`). The Podfile uses the existing
# MoproFfi.podspec (note the capitalization), so the regenerated one is a stale
# duplicate. Ignore it so the working tree stays clean after `make ios`.
mopro-ffi.podspec
